{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2023-07/1061862/block/singleImage/3257049/df/374fnybx6qgw_1.JPG?updatedAt=1793713306\"/><figcaption>將軍澳怡明邨中年男子倒斃屋內 傳異味揭發報案</figcaption></figure><p>警方今日(3日)下午4時42分獲怡明邨一名保安報案，指怡悅樓一單位傳出異味，懷疑有人暈倒屋內。救援人員接報趕至，消防破門而入，發現單位內一名54歲姓梁男住戶倒臥浴室。救護員檢驗後證實梁男已明顯死亡。警方將安排為他驗屍確定死因。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T14:41:29.604597+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T13:41:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T02:38:29.724887+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T14:38:30.680730+00:00","content_hash":"86d9f8e0ad3dc0f015ccc0360b1704cb25408b34e739b0462b19e69a9f2f20fd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}